(7565308, 1213455, 194290, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by primabarbara:</b></div><hr/><i> Spectacular! Good idea to put the sun right beneath the icicle, even the flares add to the shot. The lighting looks really fine - is that all natural? I''d like to see the unedited picture some day </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Its all Natural :) it was a tough one as i literally have few minutes before sun goes down from that point, i took three shots with underexposed with f22 for the sun burst and then increased the exposure and put the self timer to 10s and ran on the frozen baikal lake to stand at right position, luckily i got what i wanted in 1st attempt.</td>', 'Originally posted by primabarbara: Spectacular! Good idea to put the sun right beneath the icicle, even the flares add to the shot. The lighting looks really fine - is that all natural? I''d like to see the unedited picture some day   Its all Natural :) it was a tough one as i literally have few minutes before sun goes down from that point, i took three shots with underexposed with f22 for the sun burst and then increased the exposure and put the self timer to 10s and ran on the frozen baikal lake to stand at right position, luckily i got what i wanted in 1st attempt.', '2018-04-09 00:03:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7565309, 1213227, 185714, '<td valign="top">Thank you for your votes &amp; valuable comments.<br/> <br/>Greatly appreciated.<br/> <br/>Cheers<br/>gin</td>', 'Thank you for your votes & valuable comments. Greatly appreciated. Cheersgin', '2018-04-09 00:03:47.000000', NULL, 0),
