(7565334, 1213342, 114285, '<td valign="top">Would''ve been a 10 for sure from me if I could vote. I have seen a similar photo somewhere along the line on a different site. I can only imagine or dream of taking a photo like this one-day. Nature at its best!<br/> <br/> <br/>Huge congratulations.</td>', 'Would''ve been a 10 for sure from me if I could vote. I have seen a similar photo somewhere along the line on a different site. I can only imagine or dream of taking a photo like this one-day. Nature at its best!  Huge congratulations.', '2018-04-09 05:02:42.000000', NULL, 0),
